The files in this directory (*.dwm circuits and macros, *.dwt templates and
the *.map memory map) are unmodified sample files from the official Digital
Works 3.0.5 package (digital-works.zip, Mecanique), used as test fixtures for
bitwerk's Digital Works importer. File names were shortened; the original
paths are listed below.

